      "statement": "When the launching runtime already matches the selected runtime, bin/qmd rewrites argv to the compiled entry and imports it in-process; otherwise it spawns the selected runner with inherited stdio, pins Node to process.execPath when launched from Node, forwards the child's exit code or signal, and exits 1 with a failed-to-launch message on spawn error.",
